From 989e587a689170718c8d158e756e7c94892a0c87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michkire Dmytro <michkire@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 23:22:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(aidl): expose active route geometry and route lifecycle
 callbacks

Add getActiveRouteGeometry (pull) and registerForRouteUpdates (push) so
external apps can read the WGS84 polyline and react to RECALCULATED,
CANCELLED, and FINISHED events without extending navigation updates.

Related to osmandapp/OsmAnd#19594
